":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"落日策蹇驴，西风吹葛衣。\n征鸿起江渚，一一背人飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37038,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其五","author":"孙承恩","text":"寒雪断人踪，千山无鸟声。\n扁舟欲何适，莫是剡溪行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37039,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其六","author":"孙承恩","text":"罨画溪山似，扁舟出柳阴。\n水风浮淡爽，凉月照虚襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37040,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其七","author":"孙承恩","text":"尘世无閒人，青山有剩地。\n相对不言语，祗话山中事。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37041,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其八","author":"孙承恩","text":"山浮草阁幽，竹影落清泚。\n爱此潺潺声，尘襟净如洗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37042,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其九","author":"孙承恩","text":"碧树障红尘，山亭多白云。\n清谈欣有伴，送酒可无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37043,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其十","author":"孙承恩","text":"山深秋气佳，衡门锁虚寂。\n扁舟载酒过，时有问奇客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37044,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其十一","author":"孙承恩","text":"茆屋依山构，沿村路不遥。\n酒旗标野店，有客过溪桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37045,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画册一十二首 其十二","author":"孙承恩","text":"云里古寺深，寒威凛毛发。\n蹇驴踏山径，不惮溪桥滑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37046,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张鹤仙四首 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"胎仙本清贞，立性亦高蹇。\n溪边日优游，不知岁华晚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37047,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张鹤仙四首 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"鹤本千年寿，医功可长生。\n会当乘天风，飞飞返瑶京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37048,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张鹤仙四首 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"步屧春风里，有鹤时相从。\n逍遥溪上人，似是浮丘翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37049,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张鹤仙四首 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"幽人寡俗务，日涉清溪隈。\n行侍无奚奴，自有胎仙陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37050,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崔少卿八咏卷 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"谁将曲江春，移置君家圃。\n先公有遗泽，勉旃期接武。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37051,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崔少卿八咏卷 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"乔柯挺苍玉，繁英簇红裀。\n喧寂各有时，莫嫌不逢春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37052,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崔少卿八咏卷 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"秋菊有佳色，浥露何鲜新。\n我思彭泽翁，清风古犹今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37053,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崔少卿八咏卷 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"此君亦可人，真姿傲霜雪。\n比德匪玩物，相看敦晚节。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37054,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崔少卿八咏卷 其五","author":"孙承恩","text":"壁立古铁色，巉巉我独拜。\n乾坤钟英灵，千古镇长在。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37055,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崔少卿八咏卷 其六","author":"孙承恩","text":"空明比中扃，有本何源源。\n兰亭脩禊事，邈矣羲之贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37056,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崔少卿八咏卷 其七","author":"孙承恩","text":"窈窕徂徕阴，阅此胎仙舞。\n千载鲍明远，莫信司空侮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37057,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崔少卿八咏卷 其八 香山寺泉亭","author":"孙承恩","text":"斜阳照石壁，寒泉浸松影。\n风生万籁虚，鹤唳千山静。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37058,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮河舟中四首 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"终日忆家愁，愁看淮水流。\n我今方此去，何日是回头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37059,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮河舟中四首 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"淮水日南逝，吾行正北舟。\n欲将双眼泪，寄向淮中流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37060,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮河舟中四首 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"北望路虽遥，出门亦已远。\n慇勤嘱淮流，为寄愁心返。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37061,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮河舟中四首 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"寄声淮水去，归思共滔滔。\n吾家何所认，门前双石桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37062,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"拉伴事幽寻，古洞共探历。\n马蹄相追随，岚气袭衣湿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37063,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"有石倚空旷，拔地何巉然。\n缓带一瞻眺，兴落飞云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37064,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"暧暧夕阳沉，林壑倏已暝。\n樵牧各归来，银蟾上松顶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37065,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"乱石倚巉岩，山径故崎岖。\n肩舆度前冈，松风吹我衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37066,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其五","author":"孙承恩","text":"浮图屹亭亭，乘暇一俯仰。\n忽然风雨来，檐铃一齐响。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37067,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其六","author":"孙承恩","text":"濯足复濯足，还以洗我心。\n浩歌沧浪吟，千古有馀音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37068,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其七","author":"孙承恩","text":"蹇驴驼一老，行行过松径。\n寻诗应几章，寒露滴衣冷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37069,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其八","author":"孙承恩","text":"旭日上曈昽，何人有瞻拜。\n我爱阳德升，万古永不晦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37070,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其九","author":"孙承恩","text":"澄湖浸云天，有亭湖之涘。\n凭栏发清啸，鱼龙或惊起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37071,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景画册十首 其十","author":"孙承恩","text":"山深无尘俗，山翁嗜玄虚。\n解琴时一鼓，引出溪中鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37072,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"便面 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"雨收碧树犹湿，云载青山欲浮。\n欸乃一声何处，夕阳江上归舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37073,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"便面 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"突兀半空青嶂，依稀远浦渔船。\n人在翠微深处，鸟飞烟雨溪边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37074,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"便面 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"人住桃花源里，舟横独柳溪傍。\n狼籍湿云片片，幽閒凫鸟双双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37075,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"杨柳烟横谷口，桃花水涨溪头。\n有客寻真无路，满地白云自流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37076,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"碧山四围无路，岩头瀑布长鸣。\n半点红尘不到，中有高人耦耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37077,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题公子醉归图","author":"孙承恩","text":"长安道上秋日晴，城头月出人不行，雕鞍宝马曼胡缨。\n贵游诸郎总豪俊，锦衣绣带争鲜明。\n归来似是较猎馀，醉酣酩酊态度舒，垂鞭缓辔无疾驱。\n武夫健卒前执殳，牵黄臂苍左右趋。\n兰房盼倚如花姝，银缸照耀红?毹。\n弹丝品竹吹笙竽，争妍竞丽为主娱。\n甲第高门竞华侈，快意平生惟有是。\n少长宁知稼穑艰，岁月都忘老将至。\n人生几何同泡沤，从渠富贵死即休。\n石崇漫遗金谷恨，邓通空负铜山羞。\n若教声名等灭没，西山饿夫实痴物。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37078,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人应绣夫还四明","author":"孙承恩","text":"朔风萧萧黄叶飞，河梁送客歌骊驹。\n子今别我远行迈，我独恋子心依依。\n青天浩浩云霙霙，吴山高高水茫茫。\n离愁黯黯不可写，澹烟寒日孤帆张。\n子行不可留，执手且延伫。\n丈夫所志在功名，区区离别何足计。\n方今圣人急图治，网罗英俊无遗弃。\n子才人中龙，利比干将器。\n我亦无惭逐后尘，驽骀未可同骐骥。\n年光冉冉如流波，及时树立当嵯峨。\n行哉赠子言，勉矣毋蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37079,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"白鱼岂是瞿聃朋，蔑劣仁义戕群经。\n我方涵咏含醇英，似尔蟊贼吾当膺。\n攘除呵护叱六丁，吾欲与此同死生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37080,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"清宵短焰光陆离，幽窗伴我伊吾时。\n论功较德真故知，弃置岂似秋蒲葵。\n纷纷世态良可嗤，斯言有感韩昌黎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37081,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"焦桐遗制亦神奇，古音雅澹存依稀。\n琅然一曲夜何其，霜清月白风凄凄。\n繁弦急管方趋时，吁嗟若人莫可知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37082,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"昆吾夜作饥龙吼，匣里寒光射牛斗。\n神物不随尘土朽，魑魅遁迹魍魉走。\n会乘风雷排户牖，兴云作雨泽九有。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37083,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其五","author":"孙承恩","text":"古人妙墨今人收，古人心画谁能求。\n不知阅世几春秋，人间万事良悠悠。\n断文尤足当琳球，吾欲即此穷冥搜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37084,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其六","author":"孙承恩","text":"百金曾储古画图，意像彷佛超有无。\n悬知岁久成模糊，爱之我欲重为摹。\n留情一物我亦诬，谁为此论眉山苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37085,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其七","author":"孙承恩","text":"剡曲霜藤出新款，侧理罗纹明玉版。\n几向晴窗独舒卷，影落冰池锦云暖。\n何当广置三千简，绘地摹天专纪纂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37086,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其八","author":"孙承恩","text":"分得仙家乌玉玦，紫雾玄云电光掣。\n非方非员孰刓缺，尚尔么么未磨灭。\n翰林挥词此薜蘖，润色皇猷补天裂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37087,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南斋十咏 其九","author":"孙承恩","text":"歙山山头云电驰，鬼工琢石出幽奇。\n割为玄砚余得之，四方相逐昌余辞。\n岂子钝寿不足稽，泰山溜石重嗟咨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37088,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]